# interplay_fifo_timeout_report_mismatch_dies: A barrier blocked for 2 s posts a stamp-wait report (from DeviceCore::wait_stamp), which looks every waiting stampIndex up as a child id and asserts that the child there has that stampIndex (DeviceCore::fifo_for_stamp_index). Child 1 on stampIndex 3 blocks on slot 6, and child 3 exists on stampIndex 5: the host dies when the report runs, with no MMIO write to cause it (docs/testing.md, section 7.4).
